! They deep fry everything! They are my kind of people! I just have to exert a large amount of restraint each time, as I feel like ordering everything off the menu... The Deep fried Green tomatoes were simply amazing! They are the best I have ever had upto date! The jackfruit tacos are so delicious, the cauliflower tacos are a tad bit too salty, but what can one do when cauliflower is a filling! And the impossible burger hit all the right spots with the pickle inside that just gave it that right amount of pep to the burger! All praises to the chef!!! They are mighty slow though, so chill, enjoy your beer and strawberry lemonade like we did. The wait is worth it."},{"business_id":"VilDB2AuwZ5vudf99mH37A","review_id":"0zvNTb-Nn6J6x_fUlpAtsg","date":"2020-04-16T02:28:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9542005658149719,"text_excerpt":"Such a great vibe in this place. They have been open since December and still hanging in there despite the pandemic. The collards are good. I also enjoyed the impossible burger. The upstairs patio deck is really nice. The location is really in a good spot in New Orleans. They do serve daiquiris as well."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"VilDB2AuwZ5vudf99mH37A","photo_id":"5Jmubisz_K_BNSF5ZzBSCA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/5Jmubisz_K_BNSF5ZzBSCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
